#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:5 f34e68c777584399ad5defc158c10ca7
msgid "ROS with SITL"
msgstr "ROS 与 SITL（软件在环仿真）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:8 f026e13a321a49d78cc879542a3d5625
msgid "Connect ArduPilot to ROS"
msgstr "将 ArduPilot 连接到 ROS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:10 ec7a92ad3ab7446a9e6269758d120326
msgid ""
"First, a good ROS habit is to always work in a workspace directory, so "
"create one: Open a terminal"
msgstr "首先，良好的 ROS 习惯是始终在工作空间目录中工作，因此先创建一个：打开终端"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:20 f785b16dc99b499e9ec52ac788694ae1
msgid ""
"OK ROS is ready to use, let's launch an SITL instance. Refer to :ref"
":`setting-up-sitl-on-linux` to know how to install SITL. Navigate to your"
" SITL install and launch a copter session:"
msgstr ""
"ROS 准备就绪，现在启动一个 SITL（软件在环仿真）实例。参见 :ref:`setting-up-sitl-on-linux` 了解如何安装 "
"SITL。进入您的 SITL 安装目录并启动一个 Copter 会话："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:28 73392df9f5294264a37a7a8784d255eb
msgid "(--console to show mavproxy console, --map to have the copter on map)"
msgstr "（--console 显示 mavproxy 控制台，--map 在地图上显示 Copter）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:30 01fd835cf10e4c98882880326cffcbd5
msgid ""
"Now you got an SITL instance launched with TCP and UDP access, you should"
" have some line like:"
msgstr "现在 SITL 实例已启动，支持 TCP 和 UDP 访问，您应看到如下输出："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:36 48e10f7e6aa64fa79266171734360c0f
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Both \"--out\" refer to UDP connection create by MAVProxy. We will use "
"UDP access with mavros."
msgstr "两个「--out」均指 MAVProxy 创建的 UDP 连接，我们将使用 UDP 访问连接 mavros。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:38 fe0e8f4a36934106ab2cafeefc7365e1
msgid ""
"Get back to your ROS terminal. Let's create a new directory for our "
"launch file."
msgstr "回到 ROS 终端，为 launch 文件创建一个新目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:47 19945b5b18db43cea59ab262503fe872
msgid "It is simpler to write launch file than remembering ROS command."
msgstr "编写 launch 文件比记忆 ROS 命令更简便。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:49 63cea7ccf4b24695a3d59efa7375111b
msgid "Let's copy MAVROS default launchfile for ArduPilot :"
msgstr "复制 MAVROS 为 ArduPilot 提供的默认 launch 文件："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:55 5b038efd2bb64338847c70215f7a7d80
msgid ""
"You should have a new file in your directory called \"apm.launch\". "
"\"roscp\" command is just a helper to call system command on ROS package."
" Open it with your favorite editor, mine is gedit."
msgstr ""
"您的目录中应出现名为「apm.launch」的新文件。「roscp」命令只是在 ROS "
"软件包上调用系统命令的辅助工具。用您喜欢的编辑器打开它，我用的是 gedit。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:87 d9086559dbc74481a4b89cb97e7a153a
msgid ""
"To connect to SITL we just need to modify the first line to ``<arg "
"name=\"fcu_url\" default=\"udp://127.0.0.1:14551@14555\" />``. save you "
"file and launch it with"
msgstr ""
"连接 SITL（软件在环仿真）只需将第一行修改为 ``<arg name=\"fcu_url\" "
"default=\"udp://127.0.0.1:14551@14555\" />``。保存文件并用以下命令启动"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:93 48bb909696f740bc88c8bf50e04f0589
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You should see some verbose from MAVROS that read its configuration and "
"some line that indicate a connection:"
msgstr "您应能看到 MAVROS 读取配置的详细输出，以及若干表示已连接的行："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:113 f3a7cd3767134cf9823a8ead48531cd2
msgid "The connection was done !l!"
msgstr "连接已建立！"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:115 2254ce5c2c0a4fb9acb44413cb936f2e
msgid ""
"Let use RQT to how ArduPilot information are shown in ROS. Normally, "
"MAVROS will do most of the translation MAVLink <--> ROS open another "
"terminal and launch RQT with"
msgstr ""
"使用 RQT 查看 ArduPilot 信息在 ROS 中的显示方式。通常 MAVROS 会完成大部分 MAVLink <-> ROS "
"的转换，打开另一个终端并使用以下命令启动 RQT"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:122 37f47baa15064481816ef7c974d47730
msgid ""
"go to plugins/ topics /topics monitor TADAM! !!!! You see all the topics "
"that mavros has to create from ArduPilot information, click on the box to"
" see the current value. You could see in plugins/robot tools/ runtime "
"monitor that everything is ok!"
msgstr ""
"进入 plugins/topics/topics monitor，大功告成！您可看到 mavros 从 ArduPilot "
"信息创建的所有话题，点击方框查看当前值。在 plugins/robot tools/runtime monitor 中可确认一切正常！"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:126 406140e056df4a3da747d29ce9b3cf55
msgid ""
"Let's try to change mode with mavros: go to plugins / services/ services "
"caller set service to /mavros/set_mode set custom_mode to 'GUIDED' and "
"click the call button The response should be true, you can look on "
"/mavros/state topic that the mode is now GUIDED. it should be the same in"
" you MAVProxy console."
msgstr ""
"尝试用 mavros 切换模式：进入 plugins/services/services caller，将 service 设为 "
"/mavros/set_mode，将 custom_mode 设为「GUIDED」，点击 call 按钮。响应应为 true，可在 "
"/mavros/state 话题中确认模式现在为 GUIDED，MAVProxy 控制台中应同步显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-sitl.rst:132 cee5ca8e37434a07944567f762146476
msgid ""
"Now, you know the base of ROS usage with ArduPilot! ROS got plenty others"
" features that you can use like plotting, 3d visualisation, etc."
msgstr "现在您已掌握 ROS 与 ArduPilot 配合使用的基础！ROS 还有许多其他功能可供使用，如绘图、3D 可视化等。"

